# VeroDotto's scripts are bash, and a shell script with CRLF line endings dies on Linux
# and WSL with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M". core.autocrlf=true is the default
# on Windows installs of git, so pin the endings here rather than trusting every clone's
# local config.
* text=auto eol=lf
# The fixtures are documents, compared by content: never touch their bytes.
tests/fixtures/** -text
*.png binary
